---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
<nav class="nav" aria-label="Main">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="logo" href="#top"><img src="img/origins-logo.png" alt="Origins Business Creativity Workshop"></a>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#topics">What we'll cover</a></li>
      <li><a href="#facilitator">The Facilitator</a></li>
      <li><a href="#testimonials">Testimonials</a></li>
      <li><a href="#tickets">Tickets</a></li>
      <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a class="btn btn-red" href="#tickets">Register</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <img class="poster" src="img/hero-poster.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
  <video id="hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="img/hero-poster.jpg" aria-hidden="true">
    <source src="video/hero.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#fff">Origins · A Business Creativity Workshop by Leke Alder</p>
    <h1>Turn your idea into a business people will <span>invest in.</span></h1>
    <p class="tag">A two-day, hands-on workshop with Leke Alder that turns your idea into a clear, compelling and investable business concept.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-red" href="#tickets">Register now</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#topics">What we'll cover</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="strip" aria-label="Event details">
  <div class="wrap strip-grid">
    <div class="fact"><span class="k">Dates</span><span class="v">March 19–20, 2027</span></div>
    <div class="fact"><span class="k">Location</span><span class="v">Lagos, Nigeria</span></div>
    <div class="fact"><span class="k">Format</span><span class="v">In-person &amp; online</span></div>
    <div class="fact"><span class="k">Starts in</span>
      <div class="countdown" aria-label="Time until the workshop">
        <div><b id="cd-d">--</b><span>Days</span></div>
        <div><b id="cd-h">--</b><span>Hrs</span></div>
        <div><b id="cd-m">--</b><span>Min</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-top">
      <div class="sec-head" style="margin:0">
        <p class="eyebrow">About Origins</p>
        <h2>Most business ideas don't fail in the market. They fail at the origin.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="big">Origins goes back to where every business starts: <em>the idea</em>, the thinking behind it, and the discipline that turns instinct into a concept people will pay for.</p>
        <p class="lede">Over two practical days, you work on your own idea or business, with live exercises and direct feedback from Leke Alder.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="who-head">
      <h3>Who it's for</h3>
      <p>Whether you have a business already or just an idea you can't shake.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="who-grid">
      <div class="who-card"><span class="n">01</span><h4>Founders and entrepreneurs</h4><p>You're building something and need clarity on the value proposition, the customer and the brand.</p><span class="tag">70% of past participants</span></div>
      <div class="who-card"><span class="n">02</span><h4>Professionals planning a move</h4><p>You have a job and an idea you keep coming back to. You want to test it properly before you leap.</p></div>
      <div class="who-card"><span class="n">03</span><h4>Creatives and intrapreneurs</h4><p>You come up with ideas for a living, or for your organisation, and want a repeatable way to turn them into businesses.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dark" id="topics">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we'll cover</p>
      <h2>Eight topics, from the first spark to a business that can stand on its own.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="topics-grid">
      <div class="topic"><span class="n">01</span><h3>The Creative Mindset</h3><ul><li>Understanding creativity</li><li>How ideas are generated</li><li>Breaking mental barriers and building creative confidence</li></ul></div>
      <div class="topic"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Business Ideation &amp; the Laws of Ideas</h3><ul><li>Where business ideas come from</li><li>Evaluating and refining ideas</li><li>The laws that govern successful ideas</li></ul></div>
      <div class="topic"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Defining Your Business</h3><ul><li>Clarifying your value proposition</li><li>Developing a compelling business concept</li></ul></div>
      <div class="topic"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Business Plans &amp; Pitching to Investors</h3><ul><li>Structuring a business plan and pitch</li><li>Communicating value with confidence</li><li>What investors look for</li></ul></div>
      <div class="topic"><span class="n">05</span><h3>Identifying the Market</h3><ul><li>Understanding market opportunities</li><li>Finding the right niche</li></ul></div>
      <div class="topic"><span class="n">06</span><h3>Profiling Your Customer</h3><ul><li>Customer needs and behaviour</li><li>Building customer personas</li></ul></div>
      <div class="topic"><span class="n">07</span><h3>Building Your Brand</h3><ul><li>Naming your business</li><li>Branding fundamentals</li><li>Marketing communication that connects</li></ul></div>
      <div class="topic"><span class="n">08</span><h3>Why Businesses Fail</h3><ul><li>Common causes of business failure</li><li>Lessons from real-world case studies</li></ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="outcomes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What you leave with</p>
      <h2>By the end of the workshop, you'll have:</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="out-grid">
      <div class="out"><h3>A tested business idea</h3><p>Your idea run through the laws that govern successful ideas, with the weak points named out loud.</p></div>
      <div class="out"><h3>A sharp value proposition</h3><p>One clear statement of what you do, for whom, and why they should care.</p></div>
      <div class="out"><h3>A defined market and customer</h3><p>The niche you'll win first and a customer persona grounded in real needs.</p></div>
      <div class="out"><h3>A brand foundation</h3><p>Naming principles, brand fundamentals and the thinking behind the business, not just a logo.</p></div>
      <div class="out"><h3>A pitch outline</h3><p>The structure of a business plan and pitch, and what investors actually look for.</p></div>
      <div class="out"><h3>Direct feedback from Leke Alder</h3><p>Frank, practical critique of your idea during the hands-on exercises.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dark" id="facilitator">
  <div class="wrap t-grid">
    <img src="img/leke-portrait.jpg" alt="Portrait of Leke Alder in a grey check suit, arms folded">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The Facilitator</p>
      <h2>Leke Alder</h2>
      <p><strong>Lawyer by training. Strategist by calling.</strong> Leke Alder is the Founder and Principal of Alder Consulting, the creative intelligence firm he has built over more than three decades.</p>
      <p>He is credited with introducing branding as a discipline to Nigeria, and has advised on policy, politics and business at the highest levels at home and abroad. Origins distils that experience into a working method you can apply to your own idea.</p>
      <div class="creds">
        <span>Founder, Alder Consulting</span>
        <span>30+ years in brand strategy</span>
        <span>Policy &amp; business adviser</span>
        <span>Author</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="testimonials">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Testimonials</p>
      <h2>Hear from the participants</h2>
      <p class="lede">Founders and professionals who joined us in September 2026 share what changed for them. <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLHE5syv2VWeo" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--red);font-weight:600">Watch the full playlist</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="vids">
      <a class="vid" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wr2zZuwGCi4&amp;list=PLHE5syv2VWeo" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/tm2.jpg" alt=""><i class="play" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><small>Watch · 1:20</small>Deji Onadeko</span></a>
      <a class="vid" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qW9VE9DrVz8&amp;list=PLHE5syv2VWeo" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/tm5.jpg" alt=""><i class="play" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><small>Watch · 1:00</small>Seun Johnson</span></a>
      <a class="vid" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5KdEkefhJD0&amp;list=PLHE5syv2VWeo" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/tm3.jpg" alt=""><i class="play" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><small>Watch · 1:42</small>Linda Adeyemi</span></a>
      <a class="vid" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lWdVyd6uIwc&amp;list=PLHE5syv2VWeo" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/tm4.jpg" alt=""><i class="play" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><small>Watch · 1:50</small>Oluwaseyitan Jaiyeoba</span></a>
      <a class="vid" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Is80TjkOnac&amp;list=PLHE5syv2VWeo" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/tm1.jpg" alt=""><i class="play" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><small>Watch · 1:28</small>Chibuikem Chukwuemeka</span></a>
      <a class="vid" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mITHGANr4dg&amp;list=PLHE5syv2VWeo" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/tm6.jpg" alt=""><i class="play" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><small>Watch · 2:42</small>Taiwo Shittu-Alamu</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="quotes">
      <figure class="q"><p>I benefited greatly from the live critique and feedback of my business ideas.</p><cite>Participant</cite></figure>
      <figure class="q"><p>Mr. Alder was extremely generous with his knowledge, wisdom and experience.</p><cite>Participant</cite></figure>
      <figure class="q"><p>I learnt that brand is beyond name, logo etc but rather the thinking behind the business.</p><cite>Participant</cite></figure>
      <figure class="q"><p>The teachings were practical and can be put to use immediately.</p><cite>Participant</cite></figure>
      <figure class="q"><p>All the materials and conversations shared during the workshop was a total mind shift.</p><cite>Participant</cite></figure>
      <figure class="q"><p>Some home truth by Sir Alder, definitely not from the textbook.</p><cite>Participant</cite></figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dark" id="tickets">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Tickets</p>
      <h2>Choose how you'll join.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Same programme and same facilitator, in-person or online. Coming with someone? Bundle two tickets and save 10%.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="controls">
      <span class="muted" style="color:var(--dark-muted)">Prices for March 19–20, 2027 · Lagos</span>
      <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Currency">
        <button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-cur="NGN">₦ Naira</button>
        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-cur="USD">$ Dollar</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="group-label">Individual tickets</p>
    <div class="tk-grid">
      <article class="tk" data-card="inperson">
        <span class="flag">Limited seats</span>
        <div><h3>In-person</h3><p class="sub">Two full days in the room with Leke Alder in Lagos.</p></div>
        <div class="price"><span class="amt" data-price="inperson">₦800,000</span><span class="per">per person · 2 days</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li>All eight topics, taught live in the room</li>
          <li>Live critique of your business idea</li>
          <li>Breakout group work and peer feedback</li>
          <li>Workbook and session materials</li>
          <li>Breakfast, lunch and refreshments both days</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="btn btn-red" type="button" data-select="inperson">Select in-person</button>
      </article>
      <article class="tk" data-card="online">
        <div><h3>Online</h3><p class="sub">Join live from anywhere. Past participants joined from 8 countries.</p></div>
        <div class="price"><span class="amt" data-price="online">₦700,000</span><span class="per">per person · 2 days</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li>All eight topics, streamed live in HD</li>
          <li>Live Q&amp;A and idea feedback through the host</li>
          <li>Facilitated online breakout rooms</li>
          <li>Digital workbook and session materials</li>
          <li>Dedicated online host and tech support</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-select="online">Select online</button>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="group-label">Bundles</p>
    <div class="tk-grid">
      <article class="tk" data-card="bundle">
        <span class="flag">Save 10%</span>
        <div><h3>2-in-1 Bundle</h3><p class="sub">Two tickets for two people. Bring a co-founder, partner or colleague. Mix formats however you like.</p></div>
        <div class="price"><span class="was" id="bundle-was">₦1,600,000</span><span class="amt" id="bundle-amt">₦1,440,000</span><span class="per">for 2 people · 10% off</span></div>
        <div class="combo" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Bundle combination">
          <label><span><input type="radio" name="combo" id="combo-ii" value="inperson,inperson" checked>Both in-person</span><span class="cp" data-combo="inperson,inperson"></span></label>
          <label><span><input type="radio" name="combo" id="combo-oo" value="online,online">Both online</span><span class="cp" data-combo="online,online"></span></label>
          <label><span><input type="radio" name="combo" id="combo-io" value="inperson,online">One in-person, one online</span><span class="cp" data-combo="inperson,online"></span></label>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-red" type="button" data-select="bundle">Select bundle</button>
      </article>
      <article class="tk" data-card="team">
        <div><h3>Team</h3><p class="sub">Send your team. For organisations booking 3 or more seats.</p></div>
        <div class="price"><span class="amt" style="font-size:1.9rem">Group pricing</span><span class="per">in-person, online or mixed</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li>Discounted rate for 3+ seats</li>
          <li>One invoice for your organisation</li>
          <li>Any mix of in-person and online seats</li>
          <li>A single point of contact for your team</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted)">Email <span class="email" style="color:var(--ink)"><a href="mailto:info@sonderplace.com">info@sonderplace.com</a></span> with your organisation's name and number of seats.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#faq">Enquire about team seats</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="tk-note">
      <div><b>Pay in naira or dollars</b>Naira prices for payments in Nigeria, dollar prices for international cards.</div>
      <div><b>Bundles are 10% off</b>The discount applies to the combined price of both tickets, whatever the mix.</div>
      <div><b>Company invoices</b>Paying through your organisation? We can issue an invoice.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="register">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Register for Origins</p>
      <h2>Your information</h2>
      <p class="lede">March 19–20, 2027 · Lagos · In-person &amp; online · hosted by Leke Alder</p>
    </div>

    <div class="success" id="success" hidden></div>

    <div class="reg-grid">
      <form class="reg-form" id="reg-form" novalidate>
        <div id="attendees"></div>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>One last thing</legend>
          <div class="fields">
            <label class="field full"><span class="lbl">How did you hear about us? <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></span>
              <select id="f-source" name="source">
                <option value="">Select an option</option>
                <option>Instagram</option><option>LinkedIn</option><option>X (Twitter)</option><option>Facebook</option>
                <option>WhatsApp</option><option>Friend or colleague</option><option>A past participant</option>
                <option>Leke Alder's website or newsletter</option><option>Sonderplace</option><option>Other</option>
              </select>
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </form>
      <aside class="summary" aria-live="polite">
        <h3>Order summary</h3>
        <div id="s-lines" style="display:grid;gap:10px"></div>
        <div class="row" id="s-disc-row"><span>Bundle discount (10%)</span><span id="s-disc"></span></div>
        <div class="row total"><span>Total</span><span id="s-total"></span></div>
        <button class="btn btn-red" type="submit" form="reg-form" id="pay-btn" disabled>Continue to checkout</button>
        <small id="hint">Complete all required fields to continue.</small>
        <p class="err" id="err" hidden></p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dark" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap faq-grid">
    <div class="sec-head" style="margin:0">
      <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
      <h2>Questions, answered.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Anything else? Email <span class="email"><a href="mailto:info@sonderplace.com">info@sonderplace.com</a></span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <details open><summary>Do I need to have a business to attend?</summary><p>No. Origins is for people with an existing business and for those still at the idea stage. The early topics cover how ideas are generated, so you can arrive with a running business, a rough idea, or just the urge to build something.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How does the 2-in-1 Bundle work?</summary><p>It's two tickets for two people, with 10% off the combined price. Both can attend in-person, both online, or one of each. You'll enter both attendees' details when you register.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is the online experience the same as in-person?</summary><p>You get the same eight topics, live, with the same facilitator. Online participants join facilitated breakout rooms and can submit their ideas for feedback through the host. In-person attendees also get meals and in-room networking.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Where in Lagos is the workshop?</summary><p>The full venue address is sent to in-person attendees with their confirmation. <span class="tbc">Confirm</span></p></details>
      <details><summary>Will replays be available?</summary><p>No. The sessions are practical and designed to be attended live. There are hands-on workshops and exercises to complete during the sessions.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can my company pay?</summary><p>Yes. Email us with your organisation's details and we'll issue an invoice. For 3 or more seats, ask about team pricing.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#fff;opacity:.85">March 19–20, 2027 · Lagos · In-person &amp; online</p>
    <h2>Every great business has an origin. Start yours.</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <a class="btn btn-light" href="#tickets">Register now</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#topics">What we'll cover</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div><img src="img/origins-logo-white.png" alt="Origins"><br>A Business Creativity Workshop by Leke Alder. Hosted by Sonderplace.</div>
    <div>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Leke Alder. All rights reserved.</div>
  </div>
</footer>

<div class="buybar">
  <div><span>Origins by Leke Alder</span><b>March 19 – 20, 2027 · Lagos</b></div>
  <a class="btn btn-red" href="#tickets">Register</a>
</div>
</Layout>
